  "bodyHash": "7966d16c3a9fd95e",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0BsNlDT.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/適用於%20Minecraft-1.19%20%7C%201.18-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"295\" height=\"28\" />&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安裝於-客戶端%20%26%20伺服器-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7498\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7499\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Magnum Torch</strong> 添加了三種非常強力的火把，可在巨大範圍內阻止生物生成。僅會阻止自然生成，因此例如刷怪籠和襲擊等機制仍會正常運作。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📚 內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">你製作的火把類型決定了將阻止哪種生物生成。僅會阻止新生物生成，放置火把時世界中已存在的生物不會立即消失！</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>鑽石：</strong> 所有敵對生物，例如殭屍、骷髏、苦力怕、蜘蛛、幻翼等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>綠寶石：</strong> 被動生物，例如流浪商人與商羊駝（動物在技術上會受到影響，但實際上不會，因為它們僅在世界生成或繁殖時出現，這兩者均不受火把影響）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>紫水晶：</strong> 洞穴與水生生物，例如蝙蝠、所有魷魚、美西螈以及所有魚類</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更棒的是：每種火把均可完全自訂，包括有效範圍、阻止生成的形狀（長方體、圓柱體、橢球體）、個別生物的白名單／黑名單，以及阻止的生物類型（敵對／水生／洞穴／被動）。因此，如果你願意，可以完全改變不同類型的用途，例如讓一種類型只阻止幻翼生成，另一種專門處理流浪商人，而第三種則禁用所有魚類。這完全取決於你！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📷 媒體：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/542/2022-03-12_15.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/543/2022-03-13_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>三種火把，各自阻止不同的生物生成</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>村莊中的綠寶石火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/544/2022-03-13_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/545/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>物品提示資訊會顯示你需要知道的所有重要參數</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>製作鑽石火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/546/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/440/547/2022-03-13_10.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>製作綠寶石火把</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>製作紫水晶火把</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：如何在 Forge 上設定此模組？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的 <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模組並直接在遊戲內進行設定！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：如何在 Fabric 上設定此模組？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未實作遊戲內直接編輯設定檔的功能。請在進入世界後，執行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 指令，選擇 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（視模組而定），然後點擊聊天欄中出現的檔案名稱（副檔名為 .toml），即可在外部編輯器中手動編輯設定檔。儲存檔案後，設定檔會在幾秒後自動於遊戲內重新載入，無需重新啟動遊戲。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>問：如何下載 1.19 之前 Minecraft 版本的 Fabric 模組？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>舊版下載點請前往<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-fabric\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>舊專案頁面</strong></span></a>。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>🏆 致謝：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Magnum Torch 的開發過程中獲得以下協助與靈感：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>RWTema</strong></span></a>：啟發本模組，靈感來自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Extra Utilities</span></a> 模組舊版本中的大型火把方塊</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nyffuuuh23\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Nyffuuuh23</strong></span></a>：製作了這些精美的紋理</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs%200212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bag-of-holding-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8gTQlTt.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-runner-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5rv6nTt.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-enchants-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MynoO6R.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sneaky-curses-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LgxIMFS.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C2JV3xu.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
